## 2. Commercial use requires a paid license

If you use a XEH product commercially, meaning any use intended to
earn money, directly or indirectly, you must buy a license from XEH
before such use. This includes company websites, client work, and any
product or service used to generate revenue. The license is available as
a one-time purchase or a periodic fee, as offered by XEH at the time of
purchase. Without a paid commercial license, commercial use is not
permitted.

## 3. What you may not do

- Remove or alter this license or copyright notices from the product or
